---
alwaysApply: true
---

When using vite + tailwindcss, check online for newest integration method. 
When generating frontends, make sure the UI is modern and beautiful. 
When using graphql subscription, make sure there is only one active websocket that is reused across the entire app. There should be a single instance of apollo client for the entire app. 
Never cache anything at the GraphQL level.
When debugging, make sure to check both console and network when unexpected things occur. When dealing with asynchronous requests, check the messages of the relevant websockets. 
When using GraphQL with Apollo Client, generate TypeScript types with GraphQL Code Generator. After writing or modifying operations, run `npm run codegen` (`graphql-codegen --config codegen.ts`). Use the generated types.
When initiating a chrome cdt debugging session, make sure to clear existing state such as local storage or cookies. 